<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/infographic-ai-readiness.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<div class="n3l-readiness">
<figure class="fig">

  <header class="mast">
    <span class="eyebrow brand-eyebrow">NEXT3LABS &mdash; Operations checklist</span>
    <h1>Is this process <span class="hi">ready</span> to hand to AI?</h1>
    <p class="sub">7 checks. Run them <strong>before you spend anything.</strong></p>
    <div class="mast-rule"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="checks-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">The seven checks</span>
    <span class="legend"><i class="lamp mini" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i> green light = pass</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="checks">

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>One process</h3>
        <p>Nameable in a single sentence.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>&ldquo;Correct&rdquo; is written down</h3>
        <p>A stranger could check output against it.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Inputs are reachable</h3>
        <p>Predictable shape, findable location.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Errors are survivable</h3>
        <p>And surface before they cost.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Baseline measured</h3>
        <p>Time per instance, error rate, dated day zero.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>A named owner</h3>
        <p>One person answers for the result.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

    <li class="check">
      <span class="idx num" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
      <div class="body">
        <h3>Human checkpoint</h3>
        <p>At the boundary, every time at first.</p>
      </div>
      <i class="lamp" aria-hidden="true"><b>&#10003;</b></i>
    </li>

  </ol>

  <figcaption class="foot">
    <span class="verdict"><b class="num">7/7</b> = ready to pilot</span>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <span class="verdict"><b>fewer</b> = your work list</span>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
    <span class="verdict twist">none of the 7 is about tools</span>
  </figcaption>

</figure>
</div>
